# LIMS queue / list UI chrome

**Visual reference:** `resources/js/components/analyst/analyst-queue-panel.tsx` and Receiving (`resources/js/pages/receiving/index.tsx`) after unify. Keep each role’s domain columns; match shell, density, chips, and CTAs.

## Shared building blocks

- KPIs: `@/components/lims/queue-summary-cards` (`QueueSummaryCards`) — do not invent per-role KPI card layouts.
- Filters: `@/components/queue-filter-bar` — soft `rounded-lg` tabs (not pills), compact search, optional inline `Sort:` select (Analyst row pattern).

- Fonts/colors: Manrope + `nppc-*` tokens (see `react-inertia-ui`).

## Table shell

```
outer: overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-xs
inner: overflow-x-auto
footer: border-t border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/50 px-4 py-3  ← TablePagination here
```

- Sticky header: `bg-slate-50/90`, `text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase text-slate-500`, cells `px-4 py-3`
- Body: `divide-y divide-slate-200/80`; cells `px-4 py-4 align-top`; rows `hover:bg-slate-50`
- Keep role-specific row tints (e.g. awaiting Head amber, JO approved emerald)

## Reference / identity

- JO id chip: `JO #{ref}` with `rounded border … font-mono text-xs font-bold` (amber emphasize when awaiting Head)

## Typography

- Primary line: `font-semibold text-slate-900`
- Meta line: `text-[11px] text-slate-500`
- Empty state: `font-medium text-nppc-900` title + muted supporting line

## Actions (CTAs)

- No bordered “action cage” around buttons
- Outline secondary (e.g. Print) + primary `bg-nppc-900 hover:bg-nppc-700` with `ArrowRight`
- Amber primary tone only for awaiting-Head-style states
- Right-align the action cell

## Do not

- Change workflow, validation, or API contracts when restyling
- Restyle controlled PDF / Form Designer UIs with this chrome — use those rules instead
